      ],
      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "The BeachChair Shoulder Positioning System has been designed to provide the",
        "surgeon a secure method of performing arthroscopic and open shoulder surgery with",
        "the patient in a seated position. The use of the BeachChair reduces the possibility of",
        "neurapraxia associated with the use of traction when arthroscopy is performed with the",
        "patient in the lateral decubitus position. This device will lock onto all standard operating",
        "room tables and is easily adjustable for patient height and amount of angle desired.",
        "Essential pads, restraints,and positioning wedges are included with initial order."
      ],
      "keyParameters": []
    },
